  "details": "Build 772  Updated game like normal, joined a world, I think it was fine for awhile when I was with tupper, went to sleep, then joined on people in the morning and it started having the issues. Only FBT people IK could be seen, everyone else was default pose or using an animation. \n\nI noticed this after the update,  sometimes IK will work and sometimes it will not. My internet is blocking something cause discord images sometimes wont load or some websites won't load at all.  Logs can be provided.\n\n\nAfter restarting my modem and router and pc a million times, flushing dns, changing dns, resetting my router from scratch and re configuring it, it seems to have fixed it after 2 hours...\n\nhttps://pastebin.com/mDCYmhA2\n\nWill update post if anything else happens. \n\n",
